(text "J16.1 + J16.2: separate latching contact pair. J16.3 LED+ = 5 V; J16.4 LED- = GND.\nIdentify terminals by markings and continuity, not wire colors.\nJ17.1 -> main J23.1 switch signal; J17.2 -> main J23.2 GND.\nMain J24.8 and J25.8 share the switch signal. J24.3=GND; J25.3=NC.\nPanel ground returns through the main board. No motor/battery current on either PCB.\nNo boost converter, LED driver IC or dedicated boost fuse is fitted." (at 25.4 195.58 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid "2d5dee26-d0b9-4da0-afba-97864aca110a"))
(text "COMMISSIONING REQUIRED: verify latching operation with actual VESC hardware/firmware.\nConfirm open=OFF / closed=ON before installation. Default momentary-toggle mode is unsuitable.\nOwned switch LED is rated 12-24 V but will be run from 5 V at user request.\nMeasure current and check brightness at 5 V with a current-limited bench supply." (at 25.4 241.3 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid "f9cce122-9b86-49c4-8fe3-a44850030cc4"))
(sheet_instances (path "/" (page "4")))
(text "5 V from main J10.2 -> panel J14.2 -> power-switch LED J16.3.\nC107 is local 5 V bypass. The 12 V boost branch has been removed." (at 25.4 45.72 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid "352312a7-5507-4a5d-b668-ccbf6b656605"))

(text "MAIN BOARD: PANEL SWITCH RETURN / VESC OUTPUTS" (at 25.4 38.1 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left)) (uuid "9e3da288-0d89-46f5-ae4a-077861b9ae95"))
